# API Gateway (Express)

Every request flows: **auth → tenant resolve → rate limit → handler**.

- Verify BetterAuth API key first; resolve `tenantId` and attach to the request context.
- Enforce the Redis rate limiter + per-tenant token budget before any DB/AI work. Return `429` (rate) or `402` (budget) when exceeded.
- Always filter DB queries by the resolved `tenantId`.

## Endpoint contracts (keep stable)
- `POST /v1/memories` → persist `RawEvent`, enqueue `extract`, return `202` (never block on extraction).
- `POST /v1/recall` → synchronous hybrid retrieval; return `{ systemBlock, memories[], budget }`.
- `DELETE /v1/memories/:id` → status `DELETED` + emit `AuditLog` + publish pub/sub event.
- `POST /v1/forget`, `GET /v1/subjects/:id/export` for governance.

## Rules
- No LLM/embedding calls on the request path — enqueue to workers instead.
- Every mutating route writes an `AuditLog` entry.
- Validate request bodies at the route boundary; respond `422` on malformed input.
